{"unit_id":"FireOpalus__dsh-laa#card-zh","repo":"FireOpalus/dsh-laa","commit":"6ecc122fd48f7df91ffb9dbad9ed80d98523de51","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-laa 是面向 DSH Web 的会话级 LAA 插件：它依据可配置的 DeepSeek 峰谷时段，在峰时暂停符合条件的会话，并在谷时恢复工作。插件通过 agent 步骤钩子暂存用户输入，保存会话树的开关状态，提供 /laa 命令、浏览器开关和状态控制接口。适合希望把 DeepSeek 长任务安排在低峰时段运行的 DSH 用户；默认按北京时间工作日窗口管理官方 DeepSeek 路由，也可调整时区、窗口和提供方。无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:41-49","lib/laa.js:592-601","lib/command.js:62-69","lib/client.js:428-449"]}
{"unit_id":"FireOpalus__dsh-laa#card-en","repo":"FireOpalus/dsh-laa","commit":"6ecc122fd48f7df91ffb9dbad9ed80d98523de51","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-laa is a DSH Web plugin that pauses eligible sessions during configurable DeepSeek peak windows and resumes them off-peak. It holds input and provides a /laa command, browser toggle, and status endpoints. Timezone, windows, and provider routes are configurable. No extra API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:41-49","lib/laa.js:592-601","lib/command.js:62-69","lib/client.js:428-449"]}
